Description: ble_att.c gets hook macros for the FT GATT service and BLE diagnostics
 Adds #ifndef hooks, each defaulting to upstream's behaviour: ATT_HANDLES_TAIL
 (handle enum extension), ATT_EXTRA_DECLS (const declarations), ATT_EXTRA_DB
 (ATT database entries), ATT_EXTRA_STATE (batt struct fields), ATT_RESET_HOOK
 (reset callback), ATT_LEN_HOOK (attribute length dispatch), ATT_128UUID (128-bit
 UUID lookup), ATT_WRITE_HOOK (write dispatch) and ATT_EVENT_HOOK (event-loop
 callback). Also adds #ifdef BLE_DG / #if defined(BLE_DIAG) && BLE_DIAG blocks
 for BLE diagnostics instrumentation (skipped when not defined). Hooks only: with
 none of the macros set and BLE_DIAG not defined, the compiled code is the same
 as upstream's.
Approved-by: Dmitry Kireev, 2026-11-24
Forwarded: no
Applies-to: w0ts/optimist v0.4 (7184726b8d806506a6d0921312c0b8d6e375608b)
---
